note OVITO 3.17.2 reads extended XYZ periodicity and an out-of-cell second frame without wrapping or repeating frame 0.
note mdcompress 1.0.0 is not on PyPI and conda is not installed. apt has no libxdrfile. The refresh-bio clone reports version 2.0.5, not 1.0.0. `make` stops on the example binaries with cc: error: unknown argument: '-fabi-version=6'. That is the 1.0.0 install failure, so the coordinate-only row is omitted.
note Reads and writes that do not call the readcon writer were timed on 6e0ffcd8ee291bdc6e58427d765b78efba4b5159. readcon CON, CON.gz, CON.zst, chemfiles and CON-bin writes were timed on f3ee0f471234e112209e6ad7623b2b6e5ce8a673. 83a34ca4 adds writer tests and a wrap pin and does not change that writer or the reader. The readcon write sample blocks are that later five-arm rotation; the order write lines are the original full rotation.
